{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">《死有對証》除了懸疑緊湊的劇情引人入勝，一班演員在鏡頭背後的互動亦相當惹笑。劇中飾演高俊的馬貫東日前在社交平台大派福利，公開拍攝外景時的爆笑幕後花絮。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"maboboma_1789224397_3984624712919143385_1783351.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20260CRrT1oKVI1790137015.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"maboboma_1789224397_3984624712919143385_1783351.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">回想起這段拍攝時光，馬貫東不禁大呻2023年的暑假是他「遇過最熱嘅其中一次」！為了阻擋猛烈的陽光，相中的他竟然要踎在草地上，極度狼狽地將一塊大反光板頂在頭上當作太陽擋避暑。他更直言當時整個人被烈日當空「曬到紅曬」，隔住個芒都完全感受到那股熱氣。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"maboboma_1790089029_3991877133047306572_1783351.heic\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026zqlVyTuPPm1790137015.heic\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"maboboma_1790089029_3991877133047306572_1783351.heic\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">不過最令阿東心理不平衡，絕對是同場的好拍檔陳曉華（Hera）！在另一張合照中，他乖乖充當「護花使者」，撐起黑雨遮為 Hera 擋太陽；而身穿法醫白袍、戴住圓框眼鏡的 Hera 則一臉輕鬆，對住鏡頭單眼自拍，狀態極佳。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">面對自己熱到變「紅燒豬」，拍檔卻依然白白淨淨，Mark 忍不住搞笑地「公審」對方：「點解 Hera 姐完全冇黑到？」Hera 在帖文留言「因為hera 有把遮！ 由2023年開始，我終於發現原來有把遮佢真係可以防曬」阿東再回覆「如果唔係hera遮我應該曬死咗。」</span><br/><br/></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"maboboma_1790089029_3991877131688301668_1783351.heic\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20262R3KYe3Kje1790137015.heic\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"maboboma_1790089029_3991877131688301668_1783351.heic\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T05:38:30.572605+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":439,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}